s1 = {1,2,5,66,99,21,45}
s2 = {25,1,89,47,363,45}
print(s1.union(s2)) # we can find the union of two sets by using the union() method. union() method will return a new set which is the union of two sets. union() method
print(s1.intersection(s2)) # we can find the intersection of two sets by using the intersection() method. intersection() method will return a new set which is the intersection of two sets. intersection() method